---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | MegaMoneyMomentum (MMM)"
  description="Official Privacy Policy and Cookie Policy of MegaMoneyMomentum, detailing user data protection and Google AdSense third-party cookie usage."
>
  <article class="article-container">
    <header class="article-header">
      <div class="article-category-badge" style="background-color: var(--secondary-light); color: var(--secondary);">
        Legal & Privacy Policy
      </div>
      <h1 class="article-title">Privacy Policy & Google AdSense Cookie Disclosure</h1>
      <div class="article-meta">
        <span>Effective Date: 2026.01.01</span>
        <span>•</span>
        <span>Last Revised: 2026.04.01</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="article-content">
      <p>
        <strong>MegaMoneyMomentum</strong> ("we", "our", or "the Site") is committed to protecting your personal information and complying with the Personal Information Protection Act and international privacy standards. This Privacy Policy explains our data collection practices and third-party advertising cookie policies.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>
        The Site is an informational blog. We do not require account registration to read our articles. We may collect minimal data when you submit our contact form (e.g., name, email address, inquiry contents) solely for responding to your inquiries.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Third-Party Advertising & Google AdSense Cookies</h2>
      <div class="callout-box">
        <div class="callout-title">✓ Google AdSense & DoubleClick DART Cookie Notice</div>
        <ul>
          <li>Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads on this site based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites.</li>
          <li>Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to users based on their visit to our site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
          <li>Users may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">Google Ads Settings</a> or through <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--primary); text-decoration: underline;">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <h2>3. Web Analytics & Log Data</h2>
      <p>
        Like most websites, our web hosting servers automatically record standard log files, including Internet Protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, Internet Service Provider (ISP), referring/exit pages, date/time stamps, and click numbers to analyze trends and administer the site.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Privacy Inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data protection rights, contact us at:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> privacy@megamomo.co.kr</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
